WEBVTT

00:00.100 --> 00:02.130
<b>After seeing this scene,</b>

00:02.240 --> 00:07.440
<b>Broccoli decided to make
a Puchiko plush that size.</b>

00:07.540 --> 00:11.210
<b>We didn't have enough
to send to the U.S., right?</b>

00:11.310 --> 00:12.940
<b>We received about 3 units.</b>

00:13.050 --> 00:15.520
<b>We sold out rather quickly in Japan.</b>

00:16.020 --> 00:18.580
<b>You could change her clothes too.</b>

00:20.220 --> 00:22.920
<b>There were fans in the U.S.
who had the plush too.</b>

00:23.030 --> 00:26.050
<b>Yeah, I was really surprised.</b>

00:26.730 --> 00:29.460
<b>How did they get a hold of one?</b>

00:30.670 --> 00:32.860
<b>Did they get them through
an auction site?</b>

00:34.910 --> 00:37.870
<b>There aren't too many people
who change her clothes, though.</b>

00:37.970 --> 00:42.240
<b>In Japan, many female customers
bought them.</b>

00:42.880 --> 00:45.150
<b>And they made clothes that
matched the ones they wore.</b>

00:45.150 --> 00:48.810
<b>And they made clothes that
matched the ones they wore.</b>

01:09.340 --> 01:14.240
<b>The way the scene is expressed
is amazing, isn't it?</b>

01:14.340 --> 01:17.110
<b>They probably wanted viewers
to comment.</b>

01:24.450 --> 01:28.650
<b>Around this point,
we realized that</b>

01:28.760 --> 01:33.820
<b>this anime doesn't come full circle,</b>

01:34.560 --> 01:40.500
<b>but needs the viewers
to comment on it instead.</b>

01:42.210 --> 01:43.670
<b>I see.</b>

02:09.900 --> 02:12.370
<b>This Something Store</b>

02:14.940 --> 02:20.880
<b>appears often in
the Di Gi Charat Nyo series.</b>

02:20.980 --> 02:22.310
<b>It gets used a lot.</b>

02:22.410 --> 02:25.140
<b>We never did find out
what kind of store it was.</b>

02:25.250 --> 02:27.110
<b>What is ''Something?''</b>

02:28.550 --> 02:32.610
<b>I think Broccoli had the Something Store
open at some events too.</b>

02:33.620 --> 02:37.460
<b>It's a useful store.
You can sell anything.</b>

02:37.560 --> 02:39.080
<b>There's no need for explanation.</b>

02:39.200 --> 02:42.530
<b>Yes, so they just need
to sell something.</b>

02:57.780 --> 02:59.310
<b>These two are really nice people.</b>

02:59.420 --> 03:01.110
<b>They are.</b>

03:02.150 --> 03:04.420
<b>But they're never redeemed.</b>

03:21.970 --> 03:24.460
<b>She mentioned
the product name too.</b>

03:24.570 --> 03:30.510
<b>We actually made a key chain shaped
like Dejiko's tail back then.</b>

03:31.050 --> 03:33.480
<b>Thank you, Hikami-san!</b>

03:43.330 --> 03:45.060
<b>Apparently Dejiko can't read.</b>
